docs/program/charters/E41-deposited-origins-CODEX-REVIEW.log:2163:- **Confirmed F3 facts:** registration, absent manifest URL, licence and replacement-release note match `records/terranubis/f3-demo-2020.yaml:7–22`. Its current L1 ceiling follows from missing `manifest_url` (`src/osd/verify.py:458–460`), not a general prohibition on registration datasets.
