docs/program/charters/E46-areas-that-hold-data-CODEX-REVIEW.log:511:| OSD-D31 | Speed: map usable within 2 s, 60 pictures a second while moving, no download for an area visited before in the same visit, no download of our files on a return visit; the practices of board Shop 06; order of work: keep the present host, measure a return visit in a real browser first, add a browser cache only if that shows downloads. Four measurements are owed (real laptop and phone, return visit in a browser, zooming, globe with all wells) | E50, numbers in its PR | DECIDED by the owner 25 Nov 2026 (board Shop 06) |
