docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:1:**1. Verdict: REWORK.** The charter uses a stale F3 fixture and leaves rights mapping, provenance identity and the evidence required to award L4 insufficiently defined.
docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:8:- **External Context claims remain unverified:** E85 address intake, E35 upload rights-basis, E57 LAS/DLIS support, E123 ZGY support, E79’s shipped NLOG sample, and repository privacy cannot be established from OSD HEAD. `records/nlog/nlog.yaml:21` merely repeats the sample claim. Require an Ophiolite commit and implementation references before treating these as verified dependencies.
docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:10:- **Four retrievable LAS assets are not established:** F3’s summary describes four wells, not four addressable LAS files (`records/terranubis/f3-demo-2020.yaml:3–5`). The manifest derives assets from Collection assets and represents missing assets as unresolved (`src/osd/manifest.py:163–169`). Use an explicitly supplied offline LAS fixture; retain F3’s actual access and licence facts.
docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:15:- **STAC intake cannot recover the promised rights object.** Collections publish SPDX, a licence link and redistribution, but not statement, attribution or share-alike (`src/osd/stac.py:156–174`). Either make the manifest the sole supported input for this slice or define a version-bound standard link from Collections to the complete rights-bearing resource.
docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:24:- **Licence round-trip:** a fixture omitting optional fields passes even if their propagation is broken. Supply distinct values for every field, plus absent/null cases; assert exact values after build → manifest → reader → rights mapping.
docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:26:- **Publication refusal:** an implementation refusing every publication passes. Add an allowed-publication control and assert the specific rights refusal for each restricted case.
docs/program/charters/E09-ophiolite-reads-the-catalogue-CODEX-REVIEW.md:33:- **E06:** its recorded dispositions already reject the stale F3 assumptions and preserve missing licence fields. Reuse that contract; do not add publisher authentication or proprietary-project extraction to manufacture four LAS files.
