docs/program/charters/H1-origins-that-recover-and-origins-that-hide-CODEX-REVIEW.log:1270:docs/program/HANDOFF.md:11:- E22 merged (PR #30, main 595a30f): 121 records (25 new from 20 publishers), ten new countries (ES, PT, AT, CH, FO, TT, GY, UY, PE, MZ), seven US states (CA, CO, PA, NY, NM, OH, WV), Utah FORGE (three records), `potential-fields` 4 to 8; DGEG's purchase sentence in `licence.terms` (test pin relaxed, ruling below). Verify on the PR: 21 L1, 4 L0. Finding for a verifier slice (not E23's scope): ArcGIS Hub (NM OCD, PA DEP) and ohiodnr.gov answer 404 to the verifier's user agent and 200 to a browser one, so the verifier calls them dead where OSD-D9 would say blocked; Perupetro answers nothing from the runner or this host. Refused on 23 Oct: Louisiana SONRIS and Michigan EGLE (403), Arkansas AOGC (challenge), Kentucky KGS (TLS), Mississippi OGB (500), Montana, Indiana, Illinois pages (403/404); North Dakota DMR is a paid subscription. Held back under the `unknown` cap of six: Wyoming WOGCC, Angola ANPG, Staatsolie, PETROCI. Kinds wanted in `notes`: geological 3D model, velocity model, airborne EM and radiometrics, stress results. Verify dispatched. Records slot free.
docs/program/charters/H1-origins-that-recover-and-origins-that-hide-CODEX-REVIEW.log:1272:docs/program/HANDOFF.md:16:- E20 merged (PR #21, main a1f8832): 96 records; NRCan Canadian Airborne Geophysical Data Base (first `potential-fields` record from a retry; the GDR host still fails TLS, its successor geophysical-data.canada.ca answers), CNSOER Data Management Centre, LBEG TUNB 3D and TUNB-Velo 2.0; PASA and DGH `licence.terms.stated` are the publishers' sentences (pages named in `notes`); NAMCOR and BEG state no terms; `licence.terms.expires` coerced in `records.py` with a test; E19's count and wording pins in `tests/test_schema.py` and `tests/site/site.test.mjs` now read the record. Still refusing on 23 Oct: BRGM (connection refused), AOGCC (403), Kochi Core Center (503, maintenance notice), GSJ gbank (maintenance page), JAMSTEC J-CORES (reset), SEG-hosted sets (403). GEUS answers 404 on every page (issue #17 open; notes sentence added); EUG and DGH answer again (#20 closes on the next run). Vocabulary wants in `notes`: kinds for airborne EM and radiometrics, velocity model, geological 3D model. Verify dispatched. E22 (records, fifth twenty: US state regulators, Iberia and the Alps, Latin America, Africa, geothermal and CO2 sites) chartered and opened in the records slot (osd-e22).
docs/program/charters/H1-origins-that-recover-and-origins-that-hide-CODEX-REVIEW.log:1273:docs/program/HANDOFF.md:17:- Verify after E18: success; the pages build it dispatched publishes 92 records (82 L1, 3 L2, 1 L3, 6 L0) and the Sodir Items carry their own dates (`sodir/factpages#wellbore/4919` 2004-03-25 to 2004-03-29, `osd:period_source: feature`, extension `stac-osd.json?v=3`): E18's post-publication check passes. The STAC root is `data/stac/catalog.json`. E20 PR #21: verify green (NRCan, CNSOER, two LBEG, DGH and PASA at L1; GEUS still dead, 404 on every page); the check job is red on E19's site test pinning PASA's old wording (`/at most 10 years/`), one assertion in `tests/site/site.test.mjs` granted to E20 (shared with E21). Verify after E19: success; the published PASA record shows `access: purchase` with `licence.terms`; 92 records (81 L1, 3 L2, 1 L3, 7 L0: dgh/national-data-repository, eug/national-data-repository, geus/deep-subsurface-data, gsq/qped, sa-dem/moorari-3d-2005-reprocessing, seg/open-data-wiki, tudelft/egg-model). E20 ruling (23 Oct): E19's `tests/test_schema.py` pins record totals and the PASA terms wording, so any records lane breaks it; E20 may edit those lines (counts become lower bounds). Finding for a hardening lane: tests should not pin record totals or record wording, `validate_records() == []` plus per-record field checks is enough. E20 (records retry, publishers' sentences, `expires` coercion) and E21 (the map says when: period filter and When row on the site) chartered and opened as lanes osd-e20 and osd-e21; E07 slice 2 still waits for owner action 103 (no repository secrets or variables set as of 23 Oct evening).
