records/terranubis/nw-shelf-australia-poseidon-3d.yaml:24:  - "The page's licence label reads only 'Creative Commons 3.0' and links the BY-SA 3.0 deed; its survey description says Geoscience Australia releases the data under CC BY 3.0 AU. The label is recorded: it is the page's licence for this download, and the stricter one."
records/terranubis/nw-shelf-australia-poseidon-3d.yaml:25:  - "CC BY 3.0 AU stays the licence of Geoscience Australia's original seismic: reuse credits Geoscience Australia as well as dGB. Redistribution and attribution read the same under either licence; only share_alike depends on the label."
records/terranubis/nw-shelf-australia-poseidon-3d.yaml:27:  - "The archive's licence file states CC BY 3.0 AU for the Geoscience Australia data and names dGB's changes (8-bit stacks, well import); Occam Technology's spliced logs are CC-BY with acknowledgement. The page label BY-SA 3.0 stays as the stricter; credit GA, ConocoPhillips, Occam and dGB."
records/terranubis/nw-shelf-australia-poseidon-3d.yaml:33:notes: "TerraNubis's OpendTect repackaging of the survey recorded as nopims/poseidon (TGS's MDIO release on AWS Open Data, CC BY 4.0): same survey, different publisher, format and licence statement. Deposit (E41 design 6): a maintainer took Poseidon_3D.zip (14,236,435,784 bytes, sha256 78a08897d89cf42257b37b925da3416407e832a5eb8a36903ed86a361cc973cd) from the owner's download of 31 Oct 2026 for deposit; the deposit into the mirror is not yet made. No outline: the page gives a point and an area, not the survey's corners; the outline is derived from the archive by the pack lane."
