docs/program/charters/E49-the-python-file-CODEX-REVIEW.log:483:30:| OSD-D27 | Outlines: one exclusive switch Countries / Provinces / Basins, later Licences; an area is drawn only when a dataset sits in it; every drawn area is clickable and filters the list; Names on / off, one name per area. "Sits in it" is counted when the catalogue is built, from real well positions and survey outlines; a dataset without positions uses the middle of its box; a country-wide dataset counts for the country | E46 (the count), E48 (the switch) | DECIDED by the owner 25 Nov 2026 (board Open 01) |
