docs/program/charters/E49-the-python-file-CODEX-REVIEW.log:485:32:| OSD-D29 | Licences: no free world layer exists; read per country from the regulator on a schedule. Order United Kingdom, Norway, United States; then Canada and Australia once their terms are read. Draw licences, only those holding a dataset; name the block in the dataset row. The schedule is a stated exception to rule R6 (no timers): a weekly workflow that opens a pull request, never pushes to main | E51 | DECIDED by the owner 25 Nov 2026 (board Open 02); the weekly period and the pull-request form are the supervisor's DEFAULT |
