docs/program/charters/H2-verify-in-shards-CODEX-REVIEW.md:15:- **Earlier results are needed inside each shard.** Design 2 mentions downloading them only in the finishing job. Verification reads previous results for licence changes, blocked history and L4 carry-forward (`src/osd/verify.py:567–569,610,734–743,800`). Restore one common results snapshot into every shard; upload only freshly generated files belonging to that shard, never its entire restored directory.
docs/program/charters/H2-verify-in-shards-CODEX-REVIEW.md:21:- **Host grouping conflicts with the fixed ID-hash design.** Choose one rule before implementation. Origin-host grouping also misses shared listing, licence and input hosts; measure those request hosts before accepting parallel pressure.
