docs/program/charters/E19-vocabulary-from-the-records-lanes-CODEX-REVIEW.log:500:docs/program/HANDOFF.md:8:- E17 merged (PR #15, main 98eb254): 24 records, 92 in all, nine new countries (ZA, NA, EG, IL, IN, ID, JP, KR, TW); verify on the PR: 22 L1, gsq/qped blocked (403), tudelft/egg-model origin dead from the runner (data.4tu.nl timeout, also from this host). E17 findings for the planner: a `potential-fields` kind (NRCan, NAMCOR, EUG, PRIME gravity and magnetics); an access value `purchase` (BEG Stratton, NAMCOR, DGH, PASA); time-limited licences and pre-publication review (PASA). Unreached on 23 Oct: SEG (403), Kochi Core Center (503), GSJ gbank (maintenance), JAMSTEC J-CORES (reset), AOGCC (403), BRGM (refused), NRCan GDR (TLS); no data page at NUPRC, Ghana PC, Oman MEM.
