    10	# custody documents, which travel on `verification-results` under custody/ for the build (pages.yml);
    11	# a branch dispatch only reads the bucket (`--dry-run`). A dispatch on main naming ids also copies the
    12	# custody documents before verifying (E41), so a deposit made since the last run counts in this run. A dispatch naming `takedown_sha256` runs only
